# No provider secrets are required for the core application or on-device OCR.
# Hosting sign-in and the DB binding are supplied by Sites.
# Configure future integration credentials using supported Sites runtime settings.
# Optional one-time deployment handoff; configure as a Sites secret, never here:
# HUB_BOOTSTRAP_JSON
# Server-only 32-byte base64 AES-GCM key, configured as a Sites runtime secret:
# HUB_ENCRYPTION_KEY

# Native-confirmed hourly calendar task metadata (server-only; no provider credentials):
# HUB_CALENDAR_REFRESH_SCHEDULE_JSON

# Server-only private Cloudflare Workers AI relay settings (never browser code):
# HUB_RECIPE_AI_URL
# HUB_RECIPE_AI_TOKEN
